<p>The system autonomously triggers a strategic sequence of persuasive emails with an exclusive discount code to incentivize them to return and complete their purchase. Another great example is appointment scheduling. Integrating a calendar where your client chooses their time slot and receives an automatic reminder via WhatsApp drastically reduces no-shows.</p>
